'''Mighty Kristul Muu''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] event. It was added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]].

